# HubSpot upload ignore — files here are NEVER pushed by `hs cms upload`.
#
# The live Home page on Atomic_Lite child is maintained directly in the HubSpot
# page editor. Keep it OUT of the CLI upload path so a full `npm run upload` can
# never overwrite it. A reference copy of the live page lives in
# home-page-backup/Home.html (outside theme/, so it is never uploaded either).
#
# Pattern is intentionally the basename so it matches regardless of how the CLI
# resolves relative paths. It will NOT match Home-Showcase.html.
Home.html
theme/templates/pages/Home.html
